00:42:36.306 --> 00:42:38.066
without losing power or water

00:42:38.066 --> 00:42:39.106
for three weeks.

00:42:39.106 --> 00:42:39.906
And the helipad,

00:42:39.906 --> 00:42:41.506
which is crucial for those

00:42:41.506 --> 00:42:42.466
emergency transfers

00:42:42.466 --> 00:42:43.666
that failed JADALYZ

00:42:43.666 --> 00:42:45.186
back in 2020,

00:42:45.186 --> 00:42:47.186
is fully FAA accredited

00:42:47.186 --> 00:42:49.186
as of April 2026.

00:42:49.186 --> 00:42:49.906
Yes.

00:42:49.906 --> 00:42:51.346
And we're already seeing

00:42:51.346 --> 00:42:52.706
successful private public

00:42:52.706 --> 00:42:54.546
collaboration on the ground there

00:42:54.546 --> 00:42:55.746
proving that the logistics

00:42:55.746 --> 00:42:56.866
of operating on VAICS

00:42:56.866 --> 00:42:57.986
can actually work.

00:42:57.986 --> 00:42:59.106
Give me an example.

00:42:59.106 --> 00:43:00.226
The Dialysis Center

00:43:00.226 --> 00:43:01.266
inside the facility,

00:43:01.266 --> 00:43:03.186
which is run by a private operator

00:43:03.186 --> 00:43:04.866
for Cineus Medical Care,

00:43:04.866 --> 00:43:06.306
has been successfully operating

00:43:06.306 --> 00:43:07.186
and treating patients

00:43:07.186 --> 00:43:08.626
since October 2025.

00:43:08.626 --> 00:43:09.426
Oh, that's great.

00:43:09.426 --> 00:43:10.626
Furthermore, the construction

00:43:10.626 --> 00:43:11.986
itself was brought to the finish

00:43:11.986 --> 00:43:12.546
line

00:43:12.546 --> 00:43:13.986
by a private contractor,

00:43:13.986 --> 00:43:14.946
Korea Bay Techno.

00:43:14.946 --> 00:43:16.226
So the private sector is proving

00:43:16.226 --> 00:43:17.826
they can execute on VAICS,

00:43:17.826 --> 00:43:19.586
but what about the main emergency

00:43:19.586 --> 00:43:21.426
room, the core of the hospital

00:43:21.426 --> 00:43:22.866
that actually sets this whole

00:43:22.866 --> 00:43:23.986
wage index lever?

00:43:23.986 --> 00:43:24.466
Right.

00:43:24.466 --> 00:43:25.986
It's still not fully operational.

00:43:25.986 --> 00:43:26.546
Why not?

00:43:26.546 --> 00:43:27.986
The contract for the primary

00:43:27.986 --> 00:43:28.946
private operator,

00:43:28.946 --> 00:43:30.226
the CDT,

00:43:30.226 --> 00:43:33.266
