00:43:38.066 --> 00:43:38.946
So as of right now,

00:43:38.946 --> 00:43:39.826
the Department of Health's

00:43:39.826 --> 00:43:40.866
Field Medicine Unit

00:43:40.866 --> 00:43:42.706
is just covering emergency care

00:43:42.706 --> 00:43:43.906
on a temporary basis.

00:43:43.906 --> 00:43:45.346
And here is the single most

00:43:45.346 --> 00:43:46.866
critical bureaucratic hurdle

00:43:46.866 --> 00:43:48.226
for the local government.

00:43:48.226 --> 00:43:49.906
The Puerto Rico Department of Health

00:43:49.906 --> 00:43:51.826
must make one crucial

00:43:51.826 --> 00:43:53.186
administrative move.

00:43:53.186 --> 00:43:54.626
Yes, this is everything.

00:43:54.626 --> 00:43:56.386
They absolutely have to license

00:43:56.386 --> 00:43:57.266
this new facility

00:43:57.266 --> 00:43:59.426
as a hospital with inpatient beds

00:43:59.426 --> 00:44:00.706
if they simply license it

00:44:00.706 --> 00:44:02.546
as a diagnostic and treatment center,

00:44:02.546 --> 00:44:03.346
a CDT,

00:44:03.346 --> 00:44:05.586
exactly like the old facility was,

00:44:05.586 --> 00:44:06.306
it doesn't count.

00:44:06.306 --> 00:44:06.466
Right.

00:44:06.466 --> 00:44:07.906
Because CDTs don't file

00:44:07.906 --> 00:44:09.266
IPPS cost reports.

00:44:09.826 --> 00:44:11.506
The wage data goes nowhere

00:44:11.506 --> 00:44:12.706
and the systemic lever

00:44:12.706 --> 00:44:13.906
is completely useless.

00:44:13.906 --> 00:44:15.826
The entire territorial strategy

00:44:15.826 --> 00:44:17.026
hinges on that single

00:44:17.026 --> 00:44:18.146
licensure decision.

00:44:18.146 --> 00:44:19.426
It must be legally classified

00:44:19.426 --> 00:44:20.066
as a hospital.

00:44:20.066 --> 00:44:21.186
And because of that,

00:44:21.186 --> 00:44:22.226
the political pressure

00:44:22.226 --> 00:44:23.666
is mounting intensely right now.

00:44:24.226 --> 00:44:25.106
Just recently,

00:44:25.106 --> 00:44:27.106
on August 28, 2026,

00:44:27.106 --> 00:44:28.386
there was a major surprise

00:44:28.386 --> 00:44:29.666
visit to the facility

00:44:29.666 --> 00:44:30.786
